Q1. Check Even or Odd  Create a stored procedure check_even_odd that accepts an 
integer and displays whether the number is Even or Odd. Test cases: CALL check_even_odd(25); 
CALL check_even_odd(40); 


delimiter //
create procedure check_even_odd(In num int)
begin
if mod(num,2)=0 then
select 'even' as result;
else
select 'add' as result;
end if;
end //
