Q4. Calculate Employee Bonus   Create a stored procedure calculate_bonus that accepts employee name and salary and calculates the bonus according to the following rules. Display employee name, salary, bonus percentage, bonus amount, and total salary. Bonus Salary ≥ 100000 ≥ 50000 20% 15% ≥ 30000 Below 30000 10% 5% 
